      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchadagi '-gandan keyin', '-gach' bilan bir xil: 'bitirGANDAN KEYIN' = 졸업한 후에.",
      "compare_en": "Like English 'after …ing': 'after graduating' = 졸업한 후에. The verb takes the past-modifier -(으)ㄴ because the action is finished."
